    {
      "key": "srd-2024_wizard_spellcasting",
      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "description": "As a student of arcane magic, you have learned to cast spells. Intelligence is your spellcasting ability.\n\n**Spell save DC** = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Intelligence modifier\n**Spell attack modifier** = your proficiency bonus + your Intelligence modifier\n\nYou start with a spellbook containing 6 level 1 Wizard spells. You add 2 Wizard spells to your spellbook each level.\n\n**Cantrips:** 3 (L1), 4 (L4), 5 (L10).\n**Prepared Spells:** Fixed by class table. Starting at 4 at L1, scaling to 25 at L20. Chosen from your spellbook. Changed after each Long Rest.\n\nYou can use an Arcane Focus or your spellbook as a Spellcasting Focus.",
      "gainedAtLevel": 1,
      "displayOrder": 1,
      "effects": [
